<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Forest Guardian | Wildwood Rescue</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css"></head>
<body><div class="fireflies" aria-hidden="true"></div><header><div class="brand">🌿 FOREST GUARDIAN <small>WILDWOOD RESCUE</small></div><div id="account" class="account"></div></header>
<main>
<section id="authScreen" class="screen auth-layout"><div class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">A WILDERNESS ADVENTURE</span><h1>Restore the forest.<br><em>Gather its glowing seeds.</em></h1><p>Explore enchanted woodland, dodge thorny brambles and solve a live API puzzle to protect the ancient Elderwood.</p><div class="forest-art">🦊 <span>🌳</span> 🦉 <span>🍃</span> 🦌</div></div><form id="authForm" class="panel auth-panel"><h2 id="authTitle">Create your guardian</h2><p class="muted">Your progress will be saved on this computer's PHP server.</p><label>Guardian name<input id="username" autocomplete="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="20" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_]+" placeholder="e.g. ForestFriend"></label><label>Password<input id="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="6" placeholder="At least 6 characters"></label><div class="muted">Choose your woodland companion</div><div class="avatars" id="avatars"><button type="button" class="avatar selected" data-avatar="fox" aria-label="Fox companion">🦊</button><button type="button" class="avatar" data-avatar="deer" aria-label="Deer companion">🦌</button><button type="button" class="avatar" data-avatar="owl" aria-label="Owl companion">🦉</button><button type="button" class="avatar" data-avatar="bear" aria-label="Bear companion">🐻</button></div><button class="primary" id="authSubmit">Create account</button><button type="button" class="link-btn" id="toggleAuth">Already have an account? Sign in</button><p id="authError" class="error" role="alert"></p></form></section>
<section id="menuScreen" class="screen hidden"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">FOREST WATCH</span><h1>Choose your adventure</h1><p id="welcome"></p></div><div class="menu-grid"><article class="panel level-card"><div class="level-emoji">🌳</div><div class="eyebrow">LEVEL 01</div><h2>Whispering Woods</h2><p>Gather 12 glowing seeds before time runs out. Dodge thorny brambles and protect your three hearts.</p><button class="primary" data-start="1">Explore the Woods</button></article><article class="panel level-card"><div class="level-emoji">🌙</div><div class="eyebrow">LEVEL 02</div><h2>Elderwood at Dusk</h2><p>Faster brambles, more seeds, and a deeper challenge. Unlock by completing Level 1 and its live API puzzle.</p><button class="primary" data-start="2" id="level2Btn">🔒 Locked</button></article><article class="panel score-card"><div class="level-emoji">🏆</div><h2>Guardian records</h2><p>Personal best</p><div class="big-number" id="bestScore">0</div><p id="levelStatus"></p><h3>Recent adventures</h3><div id="history" class="history"></div></article></div></section>
<section id="gameScreen" class="screen hidden"><div class="game-top"><div><span class="eyebrow" id="zoneName">WHISPERING WOODS</span><h2>Forest Guardian Mission</h2></div><button class="secondary" id="quitBtn">Exit to menu</button></div><div class="hud"><div>⭐ Score <strong id="score">0</strong></div><div>🍃 Seeds <strong id="seedCount">0 / 12</strong></div><div>❤️ Lives <strong id="lives">3</strong></div><div>⏱️ Time <strong id="time">60</strong></div></div><div class="game-shell"><canvas id="gameCanvas" width="960" height="540" aria-label="Forest adventure game area"></canvas><div id="gameOverlay" class="game-overlay hidden"><div class="panel overlay-card"><h2 id="overlayTitle"></h2><p id="overlayMessage"></p><button class="primary" id="overlayAction"></button><button class="secondary" id="overlayMenu">Back to menu</button></div></div></div><div class="game-help">Move: <kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> or arrow keys · Pause: <kbd>P</kbd> · Mobile: use the directional buttons</div><div class="touch-controls"><button data-dir="up">▲</button><div><button data-dir="left">◀</button><button data-dir="down">▼</button><button data-dir="right">▶</button></div></div></section>
<section id="challengeScreen" class="screen hidden"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">INTEROPERABILITY MISSION</span><h1>Forest Guardian API Challenge</h1><p>Solve a puzzle from the live University Fish Game service to earn the Elderwood's trust.</p></div><div class="panel challenge"><p id="apiStatus" role="status">Loading live challenge…</p><img id="challengeImage" class="challenge-image hidden" alt="Live Fish Game API puzzle"/><form id="challengeForm"><div class="answer-grid"><label>Number of fish<input id="fishAnswer" type="number" min="0" max="99" required></label><label>Number of chests<input id="chestAnswer" type="number" min="0" max="99" required></label></div><button class="primary" id="checkBtn" disabled>Check answers</button></form><p id="challengeFeedback" role="status"></p><button class="secondary" id="retryApi">Load another question</button><button class="secondary" id="challengeMenu">Back to menu</button></div></section>
</main><footer>Forest Guardian · CIS045-3 learning project · API puzzle by Marc Conrad / University of Bedfordshire</footer><script type="module" src="js/main.js"></script></body></html>
